---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice | Prather Software"
  description="How Prather Software handles website visits and contact inquiries, including the planned use of Cloudflare Turnstile and transactional email delivery."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Clear about what you share."
    description="This notice describes the website’s current configuration and the contact processing planned for launch. Last updated October 29, 2026."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose privacy-copy">
      <h2>Website visits</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not include advertising trackers or analytics scripts.
        The hosting provider may process technical information such as IP
        addresses and request metadata to serve the website, maintain security,
        and diagnose errors.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        The public inquiry form remains unavailable until spam protection and
        email delivery are configured and verified. No inquiry data is
        transmitted while the form is disabled. Once enabled, it will request
        your name, email address, inquiry category, and message so Prather
        Software can review and respond. Do not submit passwords, payment
        details, or sensitive personal information.
      </p>
      <p>
        The contact implementation validates submissions on the server, uses
        Cloudflare Turnstile to help prevent abuse, and sends accepted inquiries
        through a transactional email provider. The implementation supports
        Resend; provider configuration and a verified sending identity are
        required before activation. Submission success means the email provider
        accepted the message and does not guarantee inbox delivery.
      </p>
      <h2>Service providers and security</h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare processes technical information for hosting and, when
        enabled, Turnstile verification and abuse prevention. An enabled email
        provider processes the inquiry to transmit it to Prather Software. The
        contact service does not store inquiries in a database. Application logs
        record operational errors without inquiry message bodies or email
        addresses.
      </p>
      <p>
        Learn more from{' '}
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Cloudflare’s privacy policy
        </a>{' '}
        and{' '}
        <a
          class="text-link"
          href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Resend’s privacy policy
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <h2>Retention and privacy questions</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiries may be retained in the company’s email system to respond and
        manage the related business conversation. A detailed retention schedule
        and operational privacy review remain required before the contact
        service goes live.
      </p>
      <p>
        When contact submissions are available, use the General inquiry category
        to ask about your information or request a correction or deletion. This
        notice will be updated if the website’s data practices change.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Product stores and other linked services apply their own privacy
        policies. Following those links leaves this website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy-copy {
    max-width: 820px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .privacy-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .privacy-copy h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
